{"seq":2,"slug":"query-aggregation","title":"时序查询与聚合窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/query-aggregation","wordCount":1411,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"时序查询与聚合窗口\">时序查询与聚合窗口</h1><p>仪表盘上那条平滑的折线，背后可能是把几百万个原始点按 10 秒一桶分组、每桶算个平均值的结果。时序查询几乎从不「取出某一行」，而总是「沿时间扫一段、按窗口分桶、对每桶做聚合」。这套以时间窗口为中心的查询范式，是时序库区别于通用数据库 SQL 的核心，也是 <a href=\"../foundations/tsdb-vs-general\">时序库与通用数据库之别</a> 中提到的「专用查询原语」的展开。本篇讲清时间窗口、聚合函数、速率计算、对齐与填充这些时序查询的基本功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>时序查询的骨架是「过滤序列 → 切时间窗口 → 窗口内聚合 → 跨序列合并」。过滤靠标签倒排索引锁定序列，时间窗口把连续时间切成等宽桶，每个桶内对落入的点做聚合（均值、求和、最值、分位数），最后可按标签维度跨序列再聚合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[查询请求] --&gt; B[标签过滤&lt;br/&gt;倒排索引锁定序列]&#10;  B --&gt; C[时间范围裁剪&lt;br/&gt;块级min/max跳块]&#10;  C --&gt; D[切时间窗口&lt;br/&gt;等宽桶 step]&#10;  D --&gt; E[窗口内聚合&lt;br/&gt;avg/sum/max/p99]&#10;  E --&gt; F[跨序列分组聚合&lt;br/&gt;by region 等]&#10;  F --&gt; G[对齐与填充&lt;br/&gt;处理空窗]&#10;  G --&gt; H[返回时间序列结果]\">graph TD\n  A[查询请求] --&gt; B[标签过滤&lt;br/&gt;倒排索引锁定序列]\n  B --&gt; C[时间范围裁剪&lt;br/&gt;块级min/max跳块]\n  C --&gt; D[切时间窗口&lt;br/&gt;等宽桶 step]\n  D --&gt; E[窗口内聚合&lt;br/&gt;avg/sum/max/p99]\n  E --&gt; F[跨序列分组聚合&lt;br/&gt;by region 等]\n  F --&gt; G[对齐与填充&lt;br/&gt;处理空窗]\n  G --&gt; H[返回时间序列结果]</pre><p>下表列出时序查询的核心算子：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算子</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间窗口 window</td>\n<td>把时间切成等宽桶</td>\n<td>每 1 分钟一个桶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合 aggregate</td>\n<td>桶内多点压成一值</td>\n<td>avg / max / sum / count</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速率 rate</td>\n<td>计数器单位时间增量</td>\n<td>每秒请求数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组 group by</td>\n<td>按标签跨序列聚合</td>\n<td>按 region 求和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填充 fill</td>\n<td>补空窗</td>\n<td>补 0 / 线性插值 / 前值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时间窗口与分桶\">时间窗口与分桶</h2><p>时间窗口把查询区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_{start}, t_{end}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 切成宽度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的连续桶。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个桶覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_{start} + i \\cdot w, t_{start} + (i+1) \\cdot w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8095em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，桶数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lceil (t_{end} - t_{start}) / w \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>。每个落入的原始点归属其所在桶。</p>\n<p>各系统的表达不同但语义一致：TimescaleDB 用 <code>time_bucket(&#39;1 minute&#39;, ts)</code>，InfluxDB 3.0 用 SQL 的 <code>DATE_BIN</code>，Prometheus 的 PromQL 在 range query 里用 <code>step</code> 参数定义桶宽。窗口对齐是个微妙点——桶边界是对齐到自然分钟（00 秒）还是查询起点，会影响结果可比性，多数系统支持指定对齐基准。</p>\n<p>窗口宽度的选择是分辨率与数据量的权衡：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 越小，桶越多、曲线越细，但返回点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto 1/w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 越多。仪表盘通常按可用像素宽度反推合适的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>，避免返回远超屏幕能显示的点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合函数与向量化\">聚合函数与向量化</h2><p>桶内聚合把多个点压成一个代表值。常见的有 avg、sum、min、max、count、first、last，以及分位数 p50/p95/p99。这些聚合直接受益于 <a href=\"../storage/columnar-timeseries\">列式与时序存储布局</a> 的向量化执行——对一整列连续内存做 SIMD 批量运算。</p>\n<p>更关键的是块级元数据加速：<a href=\"../storage/columnar-timeseries\">列式与时序存储布局</a> 提到的每块 min/max/count/sum 摘要，让覆盖整块的聚合无需解压、无需扫点，直接读摘要相加。一个查询若窗口恰好对齐块边界，可大段大段地走元数据快路径，扫描成本骤降。</p>\n<p>分位数是个特例——它不可由子块的分位数简单合并。系统用近似算法（t-digest、HDR histogram）维护可合并的概要结构，让分位数也能分块计算与跨块合并，代价是少量精度损失。这与 <a href=\"../storage/retention-downsampling\">保留策略与降采样</a> 中保留分位摘要的需求一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"速率与计数器语义\">速率与计数器语义</h2><p>监控里大量指标是单调递增的计数器（总请求数、总字节数），人们真正想看的是「每秒增量」即速率。速率计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">rate = \\frac{v_{end} - v_{start}}{t_{end} - t_{start}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2751em;vertical-align:-0.4509em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4159em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2963em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4509em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 看似简单，难点在计数器重置——进程重启会让计数器归零，朴素相减得出负值。</p>\n<p>PromQL 的 <code>rate()</code> 和 <code>increase()</code> 内建处理重置：检测到当前值小于前值即判定发生重置，按重置前的值补偿。这是时序专用语言相对裸 SQL 的明显优势——裸 SQL 表达正确的 rate 极其繁琐。下表对比相关算子：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算子</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>是否处理计数器重置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>rate</td>\n<td>每秒平均增长率</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>increase</td>\n<td>区间总增长量</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>delta</td>\n<td>区间首尾差（适合 gauge）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>irate</td>\n<td>瞬时速率（最后两点）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对齐-填充与跨序列合并\">对齐、填充与跨序列合并</h2><p>切窗后某些桶可能没有任何数据点（采集中断、稀疏指标），形成空窗。填充策略决定空窗如何呈现：补 null（断线）、补 0（适合计数）、补前值（阶梯保持）、线性插值（平滑）。选错填充会误导——给延迟指标空窗补 0 会让人误以为延迟降到 0。</p>\n<p>跨序列合并发生在最后：按部分标签分组，把多条序列的同桶值再聚合。例如「按 region 求所有主机 CPU 均值」会把同 region 下所有主机序列的每个桶取平均。合并时序列的时间戳必须先对齐到同一套桶边界,否则无法逐桶相加——这是对齐的另一动机。复杂的多序列连续计算往往预先物化以降成本，见 <a href=\"continuous-queries\">连续查询与物化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>时序查询的骨架是「标签过滤 → 时间裁剪 → 切窗分桶 → 桶内聚合 → 跨序列合并 → 对齐填充」。</li>\n<li>时间窗口把区间切成等宽桶，桶宽是分辨率与数据量的权衡，常按显示像素反推。</li>\n<li>聚合受益于列式向量化与块级元数据快路径；分位数靠 t-digest 等可合并概要近似计算。</li>\n<li>计数器场景用 rate/increase，内建处理进程重启导致的计数器重置，是专用语言对裸 SQL 的优势。</li>\n<li>空窗填充策略需贴合指标语义，跨序列合并要求先对齐桶边界，重计算可预先物化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时序查询与聚合窗口","id":"时序查询与聚合窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时间窗口与分桶","id":"时间窗口与分桶"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合函数与向量化","id":"聚合函数与向量化"},{"level":2,"text":"速率与计数器语义","id":"速率与计数器语义"},{"level":2,"text":"对齐、填充与跨序列合并","id":"对齐-填充与跨序列合并"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高吞吐摄取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/ingestion-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"连续查询与物化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/continuous-queries"}}